<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Retirar Fondos - Kanguroo</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        body { background-color: #000; }
        .bg-custom-dark { background-color: #0b1120; }
        .card-custom { background-color: #111827; border: 1px solid #1f2937; }
        .btn-whatsapp { background-color: #25D366; color: white; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4">

    <div class="bg-custom-dark w-full max-w-md min-h-[600px] rounded-[30px] shadow-2xl p-8 flex flex-col items-center">
        
        <div class="w-full flex items-center mb-8">
            <button onclick="window.location.href='menu.html'" class="text-white text-2xl mr-4 hover:opacity-70">←</button>
            <h2 class="text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-wide">Retirar Fondos</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="card-custom w-full rounded-[30px] p-8 text-center">
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-xl mb-4">¿Cómo retirar?</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-8">Para procesar tu retiro, serás redirigido a nuestro centro de atención en WhatsApp donde un asesor validará tu solicitud.</p>

            <a href="https://wa.me/591XXXXXXXX?text=Hola,%20quisiera%20solicitar%20un%20retiro." 
               target="_blank"
               class="btn-whatsapp w-full block font-bold py-4 rounded-2xl hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">
               Hablar con Asesor (WhatsApp)
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
